# Camera & scenes

- **AppScope** (prefab via `VContainerSettings`, DontDestroyOnLoad): `ShellService`, `SaveService`, `GameInput`, `GameAudio`, EventSystem. No camera, no world.
- **Root (temporary until 08 Ф4):** only `Startup`.
- **MainMenu:** own Main Camera (+ `StudioListener`, no Brain), splash/menu canvases, `PressAnyKeyScreen` / `MainMenuScreen`.
- **Loading (temporary until 08 Ф3):** curtain while Game loads. No camera.
- **Game:** own Main Camera (+ `CinemachineBrain`, `StudioListener`), VCams, level, lights, `WorldAudio`, `GameSession`. World audio deps come from `GameLifetimeScope`, not `Find*ObjectByType`.
- Exactly one `StudioListener` at a time. Scenes are never loaded on top of each other with two cameras.

